{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_03",
  "title": "昔話",
  "storyCode": "RI-3",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "33cbbc8c76083fb611d604ac20de6252dc41c5ed70eeb0fce09fbfe2e6bb948a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの変なガキったらすげぇな！　もう何人も倒したぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "わけわかんねぇこと言ってるが、大したヤツだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつが大族長になるのも悪くねぇな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "トミミ",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "……ガヴィルさんの仲間、ほんとに強いですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "ああ。戦闘では頼りになる。こういう時の悩みのタネでもあるんだけどな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "ようやく落ち着いてきたな、そろそろアタシがケーちゃんを黙らせるとしよう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケオベ",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "なんだ、レユニオンめ、また来たのか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケオベ",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "ドクターを攫ったのはお前たちだったんだな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ケオベ",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "逃げるなー！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "おいちょっと待て！　どこ行くんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "アタシが追う！　トミミ、お前はドクターと一緒に待っててくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "トミミ",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "あっ、はい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "トミミ",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "あっ、また次の戦いが始まりましたね。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "……ドクター、ガヴィルさんは外ではどんな感じなのか、教えていただけませんか？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "ガヴィルのロドスでの暮らしは――",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "ガヴィルさん、外でも元気に過ごしているんですね。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "……"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "もしかしてドクターは、ガヴィルさんとはそんなに親しくないんですか？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "よかったー！　あっ、いえ、すみません。ドクターはガヴィルさんと一緒に来ましたし、ガヴィルさんもドクターのことを気に入ってるようだったので、てっきり仲良しかと……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "でも大丈夫です。ガヴィルさんは優しい人ですから、きっとすぐに仲良くなれますよ！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "ガヴィルは医者として――",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "よかった、お医者さんになっても、やっぱりガヴィルさんはガヴィルさんなんですね！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "昔と全然変わってなくて……なんだか嬉しいな……"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "あの、変なことを聞くんですが、もしガヴィルさんがドクターの下から離れると言いだしたら、どう思いますか？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "悲しいだろうな。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "やっぱりそうですよね。私もあのときはいっぱい泣きました……"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "ど、どうして黙るんですか！　ガヴィルさんみたいな素晴らしい方がいなくなる事を想像して、なんで落ち着いていられるんですか！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "新しい道が見つかったことをお祝いするかな。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "ドクターはすごいですね……私にはできません。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "私は……ガヴィルさんに帰ってきてほしいって、ずっと願っているんです。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "ドクター、その、ガヴィルさんに関しては、わ、私、絶対に負けませんから！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "頑張れ。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（頷く）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "こっちも負けないぞ！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "それで話の続きだけど、ガヴィルが戦った祭典の結末は？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "あのときは……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "なんだ、大人も案外大したことないんだな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "まだアタシに挑戦したいヤツはいるか！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アダクリス人A",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大人をこんなにあっさり倒すとは……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アダクリス人B",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大したもんだな、ガヴィルは！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アダクリス人C",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "もしかしたら本当に大族長になっちまうんじゃねぇか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "私がやる！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "なんだ、お前かよ、ズゥママ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "大好きな機械いじりはもういいのか？　ったく、アタシが訪ねてもいつも無視するくせによ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ズゥママ",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "……最後に、試したくなったんだ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "試すってなにを？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ズゥママ",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "私の拳で、お前を倒せるかどうかを。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "なに遺言みたいなこと言ってんだよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ズゥママ",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "黙れ。今日は絶対負けないぞ、ガヴィル。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "へっ、やってみりゃいいさ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "結局、昼から夜まで戦っても、勝負はつきませんでした。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "最後には二人ともそのまま力尽きてしまって、他の人たちに祭典の舞台から放り出されました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "これがガヴィルさんが初めて参加した祭典での出来事です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "ズゥママってどんな人？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "ズゥママは、当時は近くに縄張りを持っていた部族の人です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "小さい頃、ズゥママは毎日のようにガヴィルさんと喧嘩をしていました。もちろんガヴィルさんのほうが強かったんですが、ズゥママも殴られっぱなしだったわけではありません。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "しかしある日を境に、彼女は喧嘩をきっぱりやめて、機械弄りに没頭し始めたそうです。ガヴィルさんがそう言ってました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "そして祭典のあの日が、ガヴィルさんとズゥママの最後の喧嘩になりました。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "その後ズゥママは、みんなに顔を見せることすら稀になりました。それから彼女の部族は引っ越してしまって、以来、私は彼女を見ていません。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "ガヴィルさんが出て行く前に乱入した祭典にも、ズゥママはやって来ませんでした。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ただいま。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "ガヴィルさん！　おかえりなさい。大丈夫でしたか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ああ。しかし足が速いなぁケーちゃんは。一瞬で消えちまった。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "でもあれだけ強けりゃ、心配する必要もないだろ。トミミ、ズゥママは来たか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "まだです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アダクリス人",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他に挑戦者はいるか！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "私が出よう。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "おっ？　ちょうどいいとこに戻ってきたみたいだな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "aliases": [
        "ガヴィル"
      ],
